to 2.3.10 and Compose to 1.10.1; migrate annotations and fix nullable dialog handling\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\nThis PR upgrades project dependencies to the latest stable versions and applies required source changes for Kotlin 2.3 compatibility.\r\n\r\n## Dependency updates\r\n- **Kotlin** → 2.3.10  \r\n- **Compose** → 1.10.1  \r\n\r\n## Source changes\r\n### Targets.kt\r\n- Migrated from deprecated `ExperimentalWasmDsl` annotation to `org.jetbrains.kotlin.gradle.ExperimentalWasmDsl`.\r\n- Added inline documentation with reference to the official compatibility guide:  \r\n  [Compatibility guide 2.3 – ExperimentalWasmDsl annotation deprecation](https://kotlinlang.org/docs/compatibility-guide-23.html#deprecate-experimentalwasmdsl-annotation-class)\r\n\r\n### AwtFilePicker.kt (desktopMain)\r\n- Added safe‑call (`?.`) operators for `FileDialog?` usage to comply with Kotlin 2.3’s stricter nullability enforcement on Java interop types.\r\n- Prevents compilation errors such as:  \r\n  *“Only safe (?.) or non‑null asserted (!!.) calls are allowed on a nullable receiver of type 'FileDialog?'”*\r\n\r\n## References\r\n- [Gradle compiler options (extension level)](https://kotlinlang.org/docs/gradle-compiler-options.html#extension-level)  \r\n- [Compatibility guide 2.3 – ExperimentalWasmDsl annotation deprecation](https://kotlinlang.org/docs/compatibility-guide-23.html#deprecate-experimentalwasmdsl-annotation-class)\r\n\r\n## Impact\r\n- Project builds cleanly under Kotlin 2.3.10 and Compose 1.10.1.  \r\n- Safer null handling in desktop file picker.  \r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-26T04:45:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T13:47:58Z","closed_at":"2026-02-27T06:32:25Z","merged_at":"2026-02-27T06:32:25Z","merge_commit_sha":"87f758bd9b620c62741b353f554c52543096e96c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"deshkaustubh:update-kotlin-compose-dependencies","ref":"update-kotlin-compose-de